Support MinGW target platform modules when cross-compiling from Unix.
Derived from MSYS2's 001-mingw-build.patch:
https://github.com/msys2/MINGW-packages/blob/d87e68ae356d773901e5c477854312e5de0548cf/mingw-w64-ghostscript/001-mingw-build.patch

This is a Yggdrasil-specific derivative, not a verbatim MSYS2 patch.
The existing Yggdrasil adaptation was further modified by AI for Ghostscript
10.08.0: obsolete build-system hunks were removed, platform modules and
compilation rules were updated, and patch context was regenerated.

